WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Start with the name. The illustrative page works without a logo or cover image.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Keep your logo whole. A wide wordmark has its own space above the name and main action.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
A cover frames the page. The cover, logo, name and black main action stay in a clear visual order.
